<h3><u>maan aa gayi hussain</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><big>haaye haaye<br>bar sare karbala<br>zakhmon se choor choor hai hussain<br>maan<br>dashte khuni me karti rahi ye bain<br>haaye haaye haaye<br>maan aa gayi hussain<br><br>jis roz watan chorh ke nikla tha meri jaan<br>nikli thi tere saath baqayya se teri maan<br>ehle jinaan bhi gham me huwe chaak girebaan<br>nana bhi tere khaak urhaate hain meri jaan<br>phatta hai kaleja haaye hussain<br>karte huwe noha haaye hussain<br>maan aa gayi hussain maan aa gayi hussain<br><br>bachpan me tere naaz uthaati thi teri maan<br>zaanu pe tujhe apne sulaati thi teri maan<br>khud bhuki reh ke tujh ko khilaati thi teri maan<br>aaghosh me jhula bhi jhulaati thi teri maan<br>ay naazon ke paale haaye hussain<br>ab ashk pilaane haaye hussain<br>maan aa gayi hussain &nbsp;maan aa gayi hussain<br><br>kya haal laeenon ne kiya dekh rahi hun<br>mein pehli moharram se jafa dekh rahi &nbsp;hun<br>hain tishna dahan aale aba dekh rahi &nbsp;hun<br>hoton pe tere shukre khuda dekh rahi &nbsp;hun<br>tu dasht me tanha haaye hussain<br>dene ko dilaasa haaye hussain<br>maan aa gayi hussain &nbsp;maan aa gayi hussain<br><br>qaasim ke tukre maine samete hain tere saath<br>maqtal me saare laashe uthaaye hain tere saath<br>furqat ke zakhm maine bhi khaaye hain tere saath<br>gham tishnagi ke maine bhi paaye hain tere saath<br>jab zeen se gira tha haaye hussain<br>mein karti thi noha haaye hussain<br>maan aa gayi hussain &nbsp;maan aa gayi hussain<br><br>aaya nahin zameen pe beta tera badan<br>us par sitam hai pyaas se sukha huwa dahan<br>manzar ye gham ka dekh rahi hai teri bahan<br>karti hai bain ay mere mazlum be watan<br>ye zulm jo dekha haaye hussain<br>zainab ne bulaaya haaye hussain<br>maan aa gayi hussain &nbsp;maan aa gayi hussain<br><br>tere badan se teer nikaalegi teri maan<br>ab har qadam pe tujh ko sambhaalegi teri maan<br>in zaalimon se tujh ko chupaalegi teri maan<br>tere dukhon ka boj uthaalegi teri maan<br>tu kitna hai pyaasa haaye husssain<br>dene ko dilaasa haaye hussain<br>maan aa gayi hussain &nbsp;maan aa gayi hussain<br><br>farhaan jo mazhar ne masaaib raqam kiye<br>rukte nahin hain aankhon se ashkon ke qaafle<br>jo bain sayyada ne sare dasht kiye the<br>lafzon ki shakl me sare qirtaas aagaye<br>kehti thi sayyada haaye hussain<br>ay laal na ghabra haaye hussain<br>maan aa gayi hussain &nbsp;maan aa gayi hussain</big></p>
               
